## 约定：空 `value` = 自动生成权限码

```java
@FieldPermission(access = { Access.READ })
Instant lastLoginAt;
// → system:users:column:lastLoginAt
```

```java
@FieldPermission(access = { Access.READ, Access.WRITE })
String email;
// → READ:  system:users:column:email
// → WRITE: system:users:field:email
```

```java
@FieldPermission(value = "system:users:custom:email", access = { Access.READ })
String email;
// 只有需要偏离约定时才写 value
```

